# The build context is the repository root (devcontainer.json build.context),
# so that the image can install the base with .setup/install-base.sh
# (docs/journal/0926f). BuildKit reads this file in place of a root
# .dockerignore because it sits beside the Dockerfile with its name.
# Everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile uses; workspace/, cellar/
# and done/ are research data and must never reach the daemon.
*
!.devcontainer/
!.setup/install-base.sh
